keywords:
  - vietnamese-legal-nlp
  - knowledge-graph
  - temporal-graph
  - legal-information-retrieval
  - civil-law
abstract: "Article/clause/point-level knowledge graph of Vietnamese civil law
  (17 corpus laws, 11,267 chunks, 14,099 entity nodes, 20,311 relation rows)
  with validity intervals, verified amendment and succession edges, and a
  stratified temporal QA benchmark (281 questions incl. 4-tier hard-upsampling
  and abstain tests)."
